::summary
A key chord is neutral words joined by plus: mod, ctrl, alt, shift, then one key.
::

::app-shell[layout=adaptive shortcuts="cmd+1=#surfy mod+k mod+2=#cloud"]

::: toolbar[title="App"]
- button[label="New" action=openCreate key=mod+n+m]
:::

::

::callout[type=info shortcuts="mod+3=#tasks"]
Shortcuts belong on the shell.
::

::cite[key=smith2020 type=article]
title: A cite keeps its own key
::
